[doorknob rattling]

40
00:05:15.190 --> 00:05:16.692
- Smells a bit. doesn't it?

41
00:05:21.446 --> 00:05:23.407
- Can we stop at the bank
on the way back?

42
00:05:23.448 --> 00:05:24.825
- What did she say?

43
00:05:24.867 --> 00:05:26.451
- What's the asking price?

44
00:05:33.876 --> 00:05:35.836
- Can we stop at the bank?

45
00:05:35.878 --> 00:05:37.171
- [speaking indistinctly]

46
00:05:37.212 --> 00:05:38.589
