49
00:06:55.290 --> 00:06:58.293
[thunder rumbling]

50
00:07:26.738 --> 00:07:28.907
- Let me know if you have
any questions.

51
00:07:36.164 --> 00:07:37.165
Hello?

52
00:09:15.013 --> 00:09:17.850
No point in thinking
like that. is there?

53
00:09:19.977 --> 00:09:21.812
Not like anything can be done.

54
00:09:24.648 --> 00:09:27.776
Just the way things are.

55
00:09:34.825 --> 00:09:36.785
[sighs]

56
00:09:55.762 --> 00:09:57.014
All right.

57
00:10:03.896 --> 00:10:06.899
