72
00:12:14.359 --> 00:12:15.444
Hello?

73
00:12:21.533 --> 00:12:24.536
[rain pattering]

74
00:13:08.914 --> 00:13:11.917
[birds chirping]

75
00:13:45.784 --> 00:13:47.703
