76
00:13:47.744 --> 00:13:49.288
No need to worry about that.

77
00:13:53.083 --> 00:13:55.169
That's why I'm here. isn't it?

78
00:14:01.091 --> 00:14:03.343
That's why I'm here.

79
00:14:05.721 --> 00:14:07.890
