113
00:22:08.453 --> 00:22:09.830
- Hello?
- Hi.

114
00:22:09.872 --> 00:22:11.206
Hi. this is Caroline.

115
00:22:13.625 --> 00:22:16.628
- Oh.
- Yeah. hi.

116
00:22:16.670 --> 00:22:18.672
I'm back home. and--
- Oh.

117
00:22:18.714 --> 00:22:21.842
- Well. actually. I'm back
in the area. and I went home--

118
00:22:21.884 --> 00:22:23.468
- Didn't you call first?
- And--

119
00:22:27.389 --> 00:22:28.599
- You haven't spoken to him?

120
00:22:32.853 --> 00:22:35.522
- Where is he?

121
00:22:35.564 --> 00:22:37.107
- He's really not well.

122
00:22:41.320 --> 00:22:43.280
You do know that. right?
- Yes.

123
00:22:43.322 --> 00:22:45.365
- We've been doing
his shopping for him.

124
00:22:47.409 --> 00:22:48.744
- OK.

125
00:22:48.785 --> 00:22:50.162
Where is he?

126
00:22:50.204 --> 00:22:51.371
- He's very ill.

127
00:22:51.413 --> 00:22:52.956
They had to move him.

128
00:22:54.666 --> 00:22:56.335
Look. when was the last time
you spoke to him?

129
00:22:56.376 --> 00:22:59.296
- OK. do you know
where they moved him?

130
00:22:59.338 --> 00:23:02.049
- I'm not--I'm not sure.

131
00:23:02.090 --> 00:23:04.801
To a--well. a facility.

132
00:23:08.555 --> 00:23:11.308
- [sighs]

133
00:23:11.350 --> 00:23:14.353
Do you know which one?

134
00:23:14.394 --> 00:23:16.522
D-do you know which facility?

135
00:23:20.234 --> 00:23:21.860
Oh. shit.

136
00:23:24.488 --> 00:23:26.532
[sighs]

137
00:23:39.670 --> 00:23:41.588
[object clatters]

138
00:23:50.347 --> 00:23:51.640
OK.

139
00:23:51.682 --> 00:23:55.894
[object clicking]

140
00:23:55.936 --> 00:23:57.938
